# The watch (Docs/Design/83-dialogue-trees.md, Phase 3): Talk with a guard opens this, and so do the wheel's Report and
# Pay fine. The way to a place (the resident tree's ways), the law, reporting a crime (World::report: what this wolf
# saw and hasn't told), a fine (only while wanted in this town: World::payFine), the bounties posted, goodbye.
#
# here.wanted and here.fine: a warrant for this wolf in this guard's town, and what settles it (the fine and what's to
# be made good). here.witnessed: the crimes this wolf saw and hasn't told. here.bounty: the bounty posted near (or the
# bandits on the roads), in words; here.camps: how many camps are out. The fines in the law's words are
# Core/RatwCrime.cpp's: 3p for a theft or an attempt, 8p for an assault.

tree watch
for role=guard
priority 3
entry talk hub
entry report crime
entry fine fine

node hub
say #watch_greet# | #greet#. #watch_greet# | #greet#, #address#.
say[here.wanted=yes priority=3] You. You're wanted, #address#: #here.fine# pennies settles it. | Hold there. The watch wants a word, #here.fine# pennies' worth.
say[on_watch=no] Off duty, #address#. Make it quick. | I'm off watch. #talk_open#
say[topic.meeting=returning priority=6] Well, well. I've not seen you since #topic.since#. #watch_greet# | Look who it is. Not since #topic.since#! #watch_greet#
say[topic.meeting=famous priority=6] You #topic.deed#, didn't you? Folk talk of it still. #watch_greet# | So you're the one who #topic.deed#. #watch_greet#
say[topic.meeting=famous_look priority=6] You look like the one who #topic.deed#. Are you? #watch_greet# | I've heard of a wolf like you, who #topic.deed#. #watch_greet#
say[pair.disposition=wary priority=3] Yes? | What is it you want? | #greet#. What do you want?
say[pair.disposition=hostile priority=10] You. Say what you want and go. | What now? | You. I'm watching you.
# ---- The Ninth Howl: the cast's own greetings (Docs/Design/86 section 6; cast-and-talk.md section 3). Each is
# gated on talk memory the campaign writes (world.mem, self.mem, pair.mem), so none plays until a key is set.
# rmx_dagfinn_thornham
say[self.id=rmx_dagfinn_thornham self.from=fenshore world.mem.nh_stage=king priority=4] #greet#. Don't call me my lord. I've a round to walk, and the alleys don't care what the Palace says, no?
say[self.id=rmx_dagfinn_thornham self.from=fenshore world.mem.nh_stage=moot_called priority=4] #greet#. A Moot, the herald says. Fen-sure, I'll keep the lamp lit till it sits. Somebody has to.
say[self.id=rmx_dagfinn_thornham self.from=fenshore world.mem.nh_stage=reckoning priority=4] They're chalking doors on my round. I knocked on every one of those doors for the Watch, no?
say[self.id=rmx_dagfinn_thornham self.from=fenshore world.mem.nh_stage=signals priority=4] Lamps on the ridges and none of them ours. I'd go up myself, but they want me on the Steps.
say[self.id=rmx_dagfinn_thornham self.from=fenshore world.mem.nh_stage=howls priority=4] I howled the fen one at the feast and half the square sang it back as a burying. Maybe it was, no?
say[self.id=rmx_dagfinn_thornham self.from=fenshore world.mem.nh_stage=letters priority=4] I've a letter for the Grayrock lord as well. The old King wrote on the back. I've not read that side twice.
say[self.id=rmx_dagfinn_thornham self.from=fenshore world.mem.nh_stage=lights priority=4] I'm walking down to the fens. Somebody from the Palace ought to stand where Mirebridge stood.
say[self.id=rmx_dagfinn_thornham self.from=fenshore world.mem.nh_stage=lights here.region=fenshore priority=4] I knew every street of it, and which flooded first. There's reeds now where the old doors were, no?
say[self.id=rmx_dagfinn_thornham self.from=fenshore world.mem.nh_stage=harvest priority=4] Every wolf I'd trust is at the Larkfield ford, and here's me holding a lamp. Bring me word, no?
say[self.id=rmx_dagfinn_thornham self.from=fenshore world.mem.nh_stage=bell world.mem.nh_writ=whispered priority=4] The City Office shuts its doors at noon now. Twelve years on the round, I know a door that's hiding something.
say[self.id=rmx_dagfinn_thornham self.from=fenshore world.mem.nh_stage=bell world.mem.nh_writ=read priority=4] The old King meant it for someone like me. I'd rather he'd said so to my face. I'd have slept better, no?
say[self.id=rmx_dagfinn_thornham self.from=fenshore world.mem.nh_stage=moot priority=4] Every post on the Line wants a keeper, and here's me with the one lamp. Fen-sure, I'll find a use for it.
say[self.id=rmx_dagfinn_thornham self.from=fenshore world.mem.nh_stage=moot world.mem.nh_dagfinn=stands priority=4] I'll stand. Not for the chair. For the round, no?
say[self.id=rmx_dagfinn_thornham self.from=fenshore world.mem.nh_stage=moot world.mem.nh_dagfinn=steps priority=4] Let the Moot keep the lamp. I'll carry it to them, and walk the round after.
say[self.id=rmx_dagfinn_thornham self.from=fenshore world.mem.nh_crown=lamp priority=5] Still walking the round on Restdays. A king can keep a habit, no?
say[self.id=rmx_dagfinn_thornham self.from=fenshore world.mem.nh_crown=ottilie priority=5] The Queen keeps the chair and I keep the lamp. Fen-sure, that suits the both of us.
say[self.id=rmx_dagfinn_thornham self.from=fenshore world.mem.nh_crown=regency priority=5] Steward of the Moot, they call it. I call it the lamp with more stairs.
say[self.id=rmx_dagfinn_thornham self.from=fenshore world.mem.nh_crown=bought priority=5] Next Moot, #address#. Howl louder.
say[self.id=rmx_dagfinn_thornham self.from=fenshore pair.mem.nh_stone=given priority=5] #greet#. You're the one who brought that heron stone up out of the mire. It's by the door, no?
say[self.id=rmx_dagfinn_thornham self.from=fenshore pair.mem.nh_found=first priority=5] You found me on the round before the Houses did. I've not forgotten it, no?
# rmx_cressida_cotton
say[self.id=rmx_cressida_cotton self.from=frosthollow world.mem.nh_stage=king priority=4] Nobody's seen him since dusk. Deep strange. He's never been late for a round in his life.
say[self.id=rmx_cressida_cotton self.from=frosthollow world.mem.nh_stage=moot_called priority=4] He keeps the lamp and I keep the round. Somebody's got to, cousin.
say[self.id=rmx_cressida_cotton self.from=frosthollow world.mem.nh_stage=reckoning priority=4] Factors on my round. I'd like to see them chalk my door.
say[self.id=rmx_cressida_cotton self.from=frosthollow world.mem.nh_stage=signals priority=4] Lamps on the ridges. Cold iron, I'd douse every one myself.
say[self.id=rmx_cressida_cotton self.from=frosthollow world.mem.nh_stage=howls|letters|lights priority=4] Still walking his half of the round. Don't ask me how he's keeping. Ask him.
say[self.id=rmx_cressida_cotton self.from=frosthollow world.mem.nh_stage=harvest priority=4] They won't let me go to the ford. Somebody has to walk the Sump.
say[self.id=rmx_cressida_cotton self.from=frosthollow world.mem.nh_stage=bell priority=4] He reads papers now. He used to read doors.
say[self.id=rmx_cressida_cotton self.from=frosthollow world.mem.nh_stage=moot priority=4] The waystation's mine on the Moot night. Bring oil if you're coming.
say[self.id=rmx_cressida_cotton self.from=frosthollow world.mem.nh_crown=bought priority=5] There's a ship going somewhere dry. I've a berth on it. Keep your lamp lit.
say[self.id=rmx_cressida_cotton self.from=frosthollow world.mem.nh_crown=ottilie|lamp|regency priority=5] Sergeant, they call me now. I've not got used to it. Don't you start.
# rm_bettany_nailley
say[self.id=rm_bettany_nailley world.mem.nh_stage=reckoning priority=4] If it's the Captain's note you're after, the cells know more than I do. I'm a sergeant; I'm not meant to know.
say[self.id=rm_bettany_nailley world.mem.nh_stage=signals priority=4] Six years I've waited for a paper like that. If you find one, you know where I stand.
say[self.id=rm_bettany_nailley world.mem.nh_stage=howls priority=4] The Watch sings the burying howl at every wake. I'd like to hear it sing something else for once.
say[self.id=rm_bettany_nailley world.mem.nh_stage=howls|letters world.mem.nh_lists=bettany priority=4] The magistrate heard it. The Watch is mine for now. I didn't want it like this.
say[self.id=rm_bettany_nailley world.mem.nh_stage=howls|letters world.mem.nh_lists=press priority=4] It's printed. Half the Watch won't meet my eye. Good.
say[self.id=rm_bettany_nailley world.mem.nh_stage=howls|letters world.mem.nh_lists=sold priority=4] They've put me on the Harbour Gate. Somebody paid for that.
say[self.id=rm_bettany_nailley world.mem.nh_stage=letters priority=4] Letters for the Grayrock lord on every desk. Say the name to me and I'll spit.
say[self.id=rm_bettany_nailley world.mem.nh_stage=letters world.mem.nh_wharf=heard priority=4] The Grayrock lord stood at the chapel while the names were read. I didn't know he could stand still.
say[self.id=rm_bettany_nailley world.mem.nh_stage=lights priority=4] There's a skipper at Rivermouth who carries more than eels. I'd like a reason.
say[self.id=rm_bettany_nailley world.mem.nh_stage=harvest priority=4] We ride with the ford escorts. Bring a lamp you're willing to lose.
say[self.id=rm_bettany_nailley world.mem.nh_stage=bell priority=4] Someone's paying the cells to forget things. I'm writing down what they forget.
say[self.id=rm_bettany_nailley world.mem.nh_stage=moot priority=4] The Watch stands at the Moot. All of it, if I've a say.
# rm_corra_slagmore
say[self.id=rm_corra_slagmore world.mem.nh_stage=reckoning priority=4] Not a good day, and not a good place. Keep it short.
say[self.id=rm_corra_slagmore world.mem.nh_stage=reckoning self.mem.nh_debt=freed priority=4] My note's gone. A wolf of the road, they say. I owe you a Watch that deserves you.
say[self.id=rm_corra_slagmore world.mem.nh_stage=signals priority=4] Lists. Everyone wants a list. I'd rather they wanted a Watch.
say[self.id=rm_corra_slagmore world.mem.nh_stage=howls|letters|lights|harvest|bell|moot world.mem.nh_lists=bettany priority=4] I've stood aside. The sergeant leads. She'll do it better.
say[self.id=rm_corra_slagmore world.mem.nh_stage=howls|letters|lights|harvest|bell|moot world.mem.nh_lists=press priority=4] I resigned in disgrace, and I'd earned it.
say[self.id=rm_corra_slagmore world.mem.nh_stage=howls|letters|lights|harvest|bell|moot world.mem.nh_lists=press self.mem.nh_debt=freed priority=4] I resigned. In honour, they say. It doesn't feel like it.
say[self.id=rm_corra_slagmore world.mem.nh_stage=howls|letters|lights|harvest|bell|moot world.mem.nh_lists=captain priority=4] Burned. And the Counting House still owns me. You know that? It'll do for now.
say[self.id=rm_corra_slagmore world.mem.nh_stage=howls|letters|lights|harvest|bell|moot world.mem.nh_lists=captain self.mem.nh_debt=freed priority=4] Burned, and sworn. The Watch keeps the lamp now.
say[self.id=rm_corra_slagmore world.mem.nh_stage=howls|letters|lights|harvest|bell|moot world.mem.nh_lists=sold|lost priority=4] Don't ask me about the Watch. Ask whoever owns it.
# rmx_desmond_hollis
say[self.id=rmx_desmond_hollis self.from=coldwater world.mem.nh_stage=reckoning priority=4] You smell of the yard. So do I. Leave it.
say[self.id=rmx_desmond_hollis self.from=coldwater world.mem.nh_stage=reckoning here.time=night priority=4] A penny a wagon day, and no names. Greatly pennies spend the same as any. Sell, or walk on.
say[self.id=rmx_desmond_hollis self.from=coldwater world.mem.nh_stage=signals priority=4] A Palace guard with no Palace. Funny, that. Say your piece and go.
say[self.id=rmx_desmond_hollis self.from=coldwater world.mem.nh_desmond=held priority=5] Speak for me at the hearing and I'll stand at the granary. Don't, and I'll not blame you.
say[self.id=rmx_desmond_hollis self.from=coldwater world.mem.nh_desmond=redeemed priority=5] I stood at the granary. Nothing came through it. That's something.
say[self.id=rmx_desmond_hollis self.from=coldwater world.mem.nh_desmond=pillory priority=5] A day in the pillory. The Sump threw fish. Fair enough, I suppose.
say[self.id=rmx_desmond_hollis self.from=coldwater world.mem.nh_desmond=fled priority=5] Go away. I've nothing for the city, and the city's nothing for me.
say[self.id=rmx_desmond_hollis self.from=coldwater world.mem.nh_desmond=mercy priority=5] They let me walk. I don't know why. I'm trying to be worth it.
mood formal
free
choice What do I owe the watch? [here.wanted=yes] -> fine
choice I want to report a crime. -> crime
choice What's the law here? -> law
choice Any bounties posted? -> bounties
choice Could you tell me the way? -> do open way
choice I was wondering about something else... -> do open chat
choice Goodbye for now. -> bye

node crime
say Go on, then. What did you see? | Out with it. Who, and what?
say[here.witnessed=0 priority=2] Saw something, did you? Go on.
free
choice I saw it with my own eyes. -> do report ; then reported ; refused refused
choice Actually, never mind. -> hub

node reported
say That's nothing new to us. Keep your eyes open, though. | Nothing we don't know. Still, thank you.
say[topic.reported=yes] #watch_noted#
mood formal
choice I was wondering about something else... -> hub
choice Goodbye for now. -> bye

node fine
say You owe #here.fine# pennies: the fine, and what's to be made good. Pay it, or you'll come with us.
say[here.wanted=no priority=2] You owe the watch nothing. Keep it that way.
mood stern
choice I'll pay it (#here.fine#p). [here.wanted=yes] -> do pay_fine ; then paid ; refused refused
choice Not right now. -> hub

node paid
say Settled. You're free to go. Mind yourself. | That's that, then. Keep out of trouble.
mood formal
choice Goodbye for now. -> bye

node law
say Steal and it's a fine of three pennies, and what you took paid back. Strike a wolf and it's eight. Pay any of the watch.
say[here.wanted=yes priority=2] You'd know. Theft's three pennies and the goods back; striking a wolf is eight. Yours is #here.fine#.
choice And if I can't pay? -> unpaid
choice I was wondering about something else... -> hub
choice Goodbye for now. -> bye

node unpaid
say Then you'll come with us, and sit in the cells until it's settled. | Then it's the cells, until it's paid.
choice I was wondering about something else... -> hub
choice Goodbye for now. -> bye

node bounties
say #here.bounty#
free
choice I was wondering about something else... -> hub
choice Goodbye for now. -> bye

node refused
say #topic.why# | Hm. #topic.why#
choice I was wondering about something else... -> hub
choice Goodbye for now. -> bye

node bye
say #farewell#. | #watch_bye#
end
